<rss version="0.92"><channel><item>
            <title>[LU-17482] short read does not set ki_pos correctly</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-17482</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;00000080:00020000:3.0:1706058118.952841:0:7094:0:(file.c:2098:file_read_confine_iter()) event.log.20240123T162623_0: read [198356992, 198361088] over eof, kms 198356992, file_size 198356992.
00000080:00020000:3.0:1706058118.952904:0:7094:0:(file.c:2098:file_read_confine_iter()) event.log.20240123T162623_0: read [198361088, 198365184] over eof, kms 198362740, file_size 198362740.&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;short read does not set ki_pos correctly, and jumps to wrong position at next read as the file being appended by others.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
