                            <comment id="401786" author="bobijam" created="Tue, 30 Jan 2024 10:51:18 +0000">&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/53827/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/53827/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-17482" title="short read does not set ki_pos correctly" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-17482"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-17482&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; llite: short read could mess up next read offset&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;When read reaches EOF, it could read data from stale pagecache, but&lt;br/&gt;
we need to restore the iocb-&amp;gt;ki_pos so that next read could continue&lt;br/&gt;
from the correct offset.&lt;/p&gt;
</comment>
